+      Own platform/doomgeneric_wasm.c, platform/runtime.c and related headers.
+      Integrate the supplied doomgeneric_Create and doomgeneric_Tick functions.
+      Implement DG_GetTicksMs and DG_SleepMs. Remove duplicate video/input stubs
