+    <button id="start" type="button" disabled>Start Doom</button>
+    <button id="fullscreen" type="button">Fullscreen</button>
+    <canvas id="canvas" width="640" height="400" tabindex="0" aria-label="Doom game screen"></canvas>
+    <p>Click the game to focus. Arrows: move/turn · Ctrl: fire · Space: use · Shift: run · Enter/Escape: menus.</p>
